gametitle=Grand Theft Auto: Vice City (NTSC-U SLUS-20552 1.40 / CRC 20B19E49)
comment=Third-person free aim with the PC crosshair (build 11). Needs Zeroable's Right Stick Camera.

[Free Aim\Enable]
author=nobz226 + Claude
description=Hold aim (L2) with a pistol, Python, shotgun, SMG, M4, Ruger, M60, minigun or flamethrower on foot: the PC version's mouse aiming (crosshair, shots to the crosshair, strafing), no lock-on; the crosshair is gently pulled onto the visible ped nearest to it (soft lock).
// code at 0x000E0000 (freeaim.s)
